    {
        "id": "ja:word:furnishings-mirror",
        "label": "かがみ",
        "class": "lexical:noun",
        "fields": {
            "pronunciation": ["かがみ"],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "A reflective glass object for seeing an image, not a computer mirror site. See your face in a mirror. Japanese 鏡 is read かがみ, with voiced が. Non-rhotic plural mirrors is /ˈmɪrəz/.",
                "de": "Ein reflektierender Glasgegenstand, keine gespiegelte Website. Auf Englisch: see your face in a mirror. 鏡 wird かがみ mit stimmhaftem が gelesen. Nicht-rhotisches mirrors: /ˈmɪrəz/.",
                "id": "Benda kaca pemantul untuk melihat bayangan, bukan situs salinan komputer. Dalam bahasa Inggris: see your face in a mirror. 鏡 dibaca かがみ dengan が bersuara. Bentuk jamak non-rotik mirrors: /ˈmɪrəz/.",
                "ja": "像を映すガラスの道具で、コンピューターのミラーサイトではない。英語では see your face in a mirror。鏡はかがみと読み、がは濁音。非R音性の英語複数形 mirrors は /ˈmɪrəz/。"
            },
            "reference_images": [
                "images/692896b0af78fea77a2fbcf43ec3f775583184858ba26103628f4930e792a51d.jpg"
            ],
            "audio": "audio/846284bee64370a1b9a593d3727420823bd835099a9a4b1af9be0a4729b5d95e.wav"
        },
